Package: bioviz
Type: Package
Title: Advanced Bioinformatics Visualization Suite
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iman", "Sadeghi", email = "i.sadeghi@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Umbrella package that loads and re-exports the ten complementary
    visualization modules (uncertainr, provtrace, scalefusion, counterpath,
    intercapsule, densweave, clinladder, survivora, cohortprism, riskweave) as
    a single coherent toolkit for advanced bioinformatics visualization. Each
    module addresses a distinct gap in the conventional figure vocabulary:
    uncertainty as a first-class channel, embedded analysis provenance,
    cross-scale semantic continuity, counterfactual dynamics, multimodal
    interaction glyphs, density-first topology, and clinical decision suites.
